# Built-in lesson. Text fields are bilingual "English|Chinese" (format: src/song/Song.h).
title: Amazing Grace|奇异恩典
artist: Traditional Hymn|传统圣诗
bpm: 80
time: 3/4
level: 2
desc: A melody in 3/4 time, key of G, first position. The first bar is a pickup (two silent beats first). Hold the long notes for their full count.|三拍子旋律, G 调第一把位. 第一小节是弱起 (前两拍空拍). 长音要保持住, 数满拍子.
desc: Tip: some notes are tied across the bar line - don't pick them again.|小贴士: 有的音跨过小节线 (延音), 中间不要重新拨弦.
